        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:0;">
          My research focuses particularly on phosphorus, one of the key nutrients controlling productivity in freshwater and coastal ecosystems. By understanding when sediments retain phosphorus and when they release it, we can better predict harmful algal bloom risk and design more effective nutrient management strategies.
        </p>
